      "text": "ETH Zurich University Archives belongs to ETH Library. It is responsible for preservation, cataloguing and accessibility of important documents of ETH Zurich and the ETH Board as well as personal papers of prominent former members of ETH.\n\n#KnowMore – The prepared content issued by ETH Library is at your free disposal and gives you a head start."
